write('.github/IPA92_V16_ACTIVATION_2026-09-13.md',`# FE QUEST — IPA Ver.9.2 question v16 activation — 2026-09-13\n\n## Verified protected import\n\nThe protected v16 batch was imported through the private main + workflow_dispatch + GitHub OIDC path and verified against production before public-safe activation.\n\n- private repository: taiwanwan64/fe-quest-private-source\n- private source/main commit: f3ee6692a2b84709c50c80f98811d7ee0b791ddc\n- content version: ipa92-questions-v16\n- imported questions: **4**\n- active protected question total after import: **1082**\n- active protected lessons: **130**\n- staging rows after finalization: **0**\n- import manifest rows for v16: **1**\n- payload SHA-256: 9b4282bda6d758e4ef57c744ea4508739e952a98abed704ac94990242fa9ce89\n- source commit recorded by manifest: f3ee6692a2b84709c50c80f98811d7ee0b791ddc\n- imported at: 2026-09-13 12:06:35.86+00\n- import workflow run: 34756180050\n- workflow attempt: **1**\n- workflow conclusion: **success**\n- protected lesson import workflow run: 34756204627\n- protected lesson import conclusion: **success**\n\nThe protected core_15_06 lesson was also verified in production to contain COSO, CSA, JIS Q 38500 and the application-control distinction. Existing lesson IDs remain stable.\n\n## Semantic-review decision\n\nThe live 1078-question / 130-lesson corpus already covered system-audit fundamentals, audit evidence, auditor independence, internal control, segregation of duties and approval. Semantic review confirmed remaining direct-practice gaps for COSO, CSA, JIS Q 38500 / IT governance, and IT general controls versus application controls.\n\nThe v16 remediation adds four original FE QUEST Subject-A questions without changing existing question IDs or protected bodies.\n\n## Public-safe activation contract\n\nOnly safe metadata for the four v16 IDs is published. Stems, options, answers, explanations, hints and choice explanations remain protected.\n\n- provider version: v376-provider-13-ipa92-v1-v16\n- merged public catalog total: **1082**\n- extension content versions: ipa92-questions-v1 through ipa92-questions-v16\n- public-safe extension metadata total: **178** including the legacy v1-v6 metadata set\n- merged Subject-A count: **888**\n- tracked Subject-A count: **897**\n- service-worker cache: fe-quest-v377-15\n\n## Completion status\n\nThis activation adds direct-practice evidence but does not promote the cluster or overall Ver.9.2 coverage to verified-covered. Practice density, required visual/interactive verification, iPhone-equivalent touch/scroll QA, and learning-history/save-restore compatibility remain separate gates.\n`);

